AutoTheCPUAndTheGraphics=Otomatis: CPU dan kartu grafis berbagi gambar (CPU\nlangsung mulai, kartu bergabung segera setelah shader-nya\ndikompilasi), lalu kartu menjalankan bayangan dan ambient\nocclusion.\nCPU: tidak pernah memakai kartu grafis.\nKartu grafis: menunggu shader, seperti sebelumnya.
;Auto: the CPU and the graphics card share the image (the CPU\nstarts at once, the card joins as soon as its shader is\ncompiled), the card then runs the shadows and the ambient\nocclusion.\nCPU: never the graphics card.\nGraphics card: wait for the shader, as before.
