ColumnsOfTiles=Kolom tile
;Columns of tiles
CombinationMethodsMinBothFractalsAre=Metode Kombinasi:\nMin: Kedua fraktal terlihat, kombinasi minimum DE\nMax: Hanya bagian yang tumpang tindih, kombinasi maksimum DE\nInv max: Balikkan DE Hybrid kedua dan kombinasikan 'Max'\nMin lin: Kombinasi minimum dengan fungsi tumpang tindih linear\nMin nlin: Seperti S1, fungsi nonlinear, tumpang tindih lebih halus\nMix: Pertama F1..FendHybrid1 lalu gunakan FstartHybrid2..F6 (dIFS) dengan vektor yang dimodifikasi.
;Combination Methods:\nMin: Both fractals are visible, minimum combine the DE's\nMax: Only overlapping parts, maximum combine the DE's\nInv max: Invert DE of second Hybrid and combine 'Max'\nMin lin: Minimum combine with a linear overlap function\nMin nlin: Like S1, nonlinear function, more smooth overlap\nMix: First F1..FendHybrid1 then use FstartHybrid2..F6 (dIFS) with modified vector.
