HowStrongTheNoiseIsThat=Seberapa kuat derau yang dihapus (1 sampai 30, seperti "Denoise DCT" GIMP).\nNilai lebih tinggi menghapus lebih banyak derau, dan lebih banyak detail halus.
;How strong the noise is that is removed (1 to 30, as GIMP's "Denoise DCT").\nHigher removes more noise, and more fine detail.
